            Start with the number on your old cartridge. If your fridge is a Whirlpool, Maytag, KitchenAid, Amana or JennAir that takes Filter 1, buy everydrop Filter 1. GE French-door owners should buy RPWFE, LG owners LT1000P, Samsung owners HAF-QIN, and Frigidaire owners EPTWFU01.
          </p>
